+#!/usr/bin/python
+# Copyright 2012-2014 Gentoo Foundation
+# Copyright 2012-2014 Mike Frysinger <vapier@gentoo.org>
+# Copyright 2012-2014 The Chromium OS Authors
+# Use of this source code is governed by a BSD-style license (BSD-3)
